{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:773","content":{"id":773,"title":"数据库","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里的数据库是类似于 Notion 的数据库，就是一份数据源，然后有不同的渲染形式。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c5377d9f-0714-427d-a283-488e39d23ec5.webp","uuid":"06d03679-1421-49ef-8fec-924fd98a1562","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c5377d9f-0714-427d-a283-488e39d23ec5.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个数据库解决不是知识管理的问题，没有自动化关联数据联动更新这样的功能，纯粹是有一些结构化的数据需要统计管理，比如看过的书，读后感关联，而简单的表格无法承担这些丰富的信息，所以就有这么一个功能。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据库支持四种视图："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"表格视图"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"画廊视图"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看板视图"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"日历视图"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"各种视图表达的能力不一样，比如我喜欢用表格视图来呈现这种架构化的信息"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e36d4280-d16f-4fc3-b196-1b1a607cab1d.webp","uuid":"99f72fee-4dfd-42c8-b87f-c4ccef3ab469","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e36d4280-d16f-4fc3-b196-1b1a607cab1d.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于画廊视图可以来呈现影视剧"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4597aa9d-1a4c-46a9-b5a6-a1bfc75adad1.webp","uuid":"a73c15e6-9ea0-46f7-ae92-a397243c0586","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4597aa9d-1a4c-46a9-b5a6-a1bfc75adad1.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看板视图可以用来进行一些基于状态的分类和管理"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5ff5aefb-069d-4380-aeeb-a8e8becc9d51.webp","uuid":"0c4ead5e-061c-4ca1-a510-891617f5d636","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5ff5aefb-069d-4380-aeeb-a8e8becc9d51.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"日历视图则可以看下自己的创作日历"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b9d0b68-dad4-4df6-bb5c-ed0144a8429a.webp","uuid":"de27c37c-24af-4a14-bdb4-e782cb392d82","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b9d0b68-dad4-4df6-bb5c-ed0144a8429a.webp","width":720}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"效率管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:757","type":"doc","id":757}},{"label":"数据库","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:773","type":"doc","id":773}}],"prevPage":{"title":"效率管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:757","type":"doc","id":757}},"nextPage":{"title":"任务待办","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:751","type":"doc","id":751}},"createTime":1767263367145,"updateTime":1777732483413,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777732483413}}